{"id":"9e293cb25f60ed71","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-term-matching.md","title":"匹配、实例与包含预序","display":"df-term-matching — 匹配、实例与包含预序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-term-matching","aliases":["56-df-term-matching"],"display":"df-term-matching — 匹配、实例与包含预序","depends_on":["[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-substitution-composition]]"],"source_section":"§2.1.4 Definition 2.1.16","source_printed_pages":"32–33","source_ocr_blocks":[53,54],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-term-matching"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-term-matching</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-matching — 匹配、实例与包含预序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.1.4 Definition 2.1.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"32–33"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>；后缀组合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Match}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in S\\mid s\\sigma=t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Match}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in S\\mid s\\sigma=t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in S\\;(s=t\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in S\\;(s=t\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\equiv_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\land t\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\equiv_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\land t\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\prec_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\land\\neg(t\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\prec_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\land\\neg(t\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Match(s,t) 固定第一项为待实例化的模式，第二项为目标；实例序的方向与原书相同，较具体者在左。匹配替换不作用于目标项。本节点给出集合论接口，未把书中匹配算法另外编码。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 及 $S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-substitution-application]]；后缀组合见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。$s,t\\in T$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 及 $S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-substitution-application]]；后缀组合见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。$s,t\\in T$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Match}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in S\\mid s\\sigma=t\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in S\\;(s=t\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"s\\equiv_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\land t\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}s.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\prec_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\iff s\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}t\\land\\neg(t\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{inst}}s).","display":true}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-term-matching.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6aa7f56f36c897f4","0df0123405bbc66d"]}